<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period March 30-April 6 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>	    March 30-Apr 6 April 1-7	   TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	   1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open 370,272.3   399,814.0</p>
<p> Production	    0		0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  22,053.6    22,007.5   898,195.7    734,933.8</p>
<p> Home Market	  352.9	 301.4    13,065.7     14,918.1</p>
<p> Stocks/close   347,865.8   377,505.1</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
